00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:11.553
Okay.

00:08:11.553 --> 00:08:15.540
So how many characters does Twit, does
Twitter allow?

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.160
You know, 140.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:18.960
Not very much.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:20.030
One sentence.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:27.080
If you can't describe what you do in one
sentence of 140 characters, do me a favor.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.420
Go back to the drawing board.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.090
Let's try again.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:33.370
You need to give people the big picture.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:37.120
The brain craves meaning before detail.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:41.240
This is one of those big revelations I
learned in communications theory.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.299
And I learned if from John Medina at

00:08:43.299 --> 00:08:46.778
