Carmine, when

00:08:46.778 --> 00:08:51.620
primitive man ran into a tiger, he did not
ask how many teeth does the tiger have?

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:54.090
[LAUGH] He asked, will it eat me?

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.430
Should I run?

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.038
Big picture before details.

00:08:58.038 --> 00:08:59.970
[LAUGH] Big picture.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:05.360
What do you do in 140 characters or less?

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:09.644
When Wendy Kopp started Teach for America
