00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:11.370
Wait a minute.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.949
The analysts in the room that day don't

00:12:13.949 --> 00:12:17.328
realize that flash will be bigger than
they think.

00:12:17.328 --> 00:12:21.420
